{"3644020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cleaner Company", "steam_appid": 3644020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark upon a galactic adventure in the most demanding sector of the space industry: janitorial grunt work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting on the bottom rung of an interstellar cleaning company, mop up the galaxy's wildest disaster sites. Using tactile cleaning mechanics in sci-fi environments, sink into a satisfying flow state. Just know it will be interrupted by random events, disastrous physics, hostile creatures, and – worst of all – <i>your friends</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/40a070fc8ac61b1ea832f1d99964e833.webp?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.poster.avif?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.webm?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.mp4?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the galaxy's worst disaster sites using cosmic vacuums, trash grinders, powerwashers and other retrotech. Complete contracts on spacecrafts, moon bases, orbital restaurants, alien research facilities and beyond. Your company-mandated hazmat suit is not enough to protect you from environmental hazards (and slapstick comedy) as you splash through blood, navigate gravity shifts, and get eviscerated by the occasional meteor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/935d3a30df79fc0fddb4b76f175d2561.webp?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.poster.avif?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.webm?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.mp4?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online co-op for up to 4 players, choose between calm cooperation and absolute mayhem. Profit from either! Designate roles (I'm the bucket guy) or run amok. Group drama is everywhere, from blackouts to comms malfunctions. Gamble team earnings and lose all your friends. Don't worry, Cleaner Company is fun in singleplayer too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/b1d61f8be279f62b254ffd508637b383.webp?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.poster.avif?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.webm?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.mp4?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene is awash with grime and punishment as you remove gore, stains, spores, appendages, and chunks of co-worker. Parasites, Slimes, Screamers and other cuties might come sniffing. Get them before they get you. The mop is mightier than the flamethrower, but it's better to take both. Or use difficulty settings to untoggle monsters and enjoy a calmer day at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/2c8a12ce007ce713d050a0dc4f263f09.webp?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.poster.avif?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.webm?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.mp4?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Climb the ranks of the galaxy’s first orbital infrastructure maintenance company by completing challenges that unlock new gear and levels. Use your earnings to upgrade equipment, health, damage and speed. And while you risk your life for your employer, collect knowledge to uncover their darkest secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In space, no one can hear you clean.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We think you’ll love Cleaner Company if you enjoy…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PEAK, Crime Scene Cleaner, Viscera Cleanup Detail, PowerWash Simulator 2, RV There Yet?, House Flipper 2, Serial Cleaner, Lethal Company, Content Warning, Alien: Isolation, R.E.P.O., Escape the Backrooms, Phasmophobia, Kaiju Cleanup, Gamble with your Friends, Cash Cleaner Simulator, Roadside Research, Big Walk, and high-quality friendslop.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark upon a galactic adventure in the most demanding sector of the space industry: janitorial grunt work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting on the bottom rung of an interstellar cleaning company, mop up the galaxy's wildest disaster sites. Using tactile cleaning mechanics in sci-fi environments, sink into a satisfying flow state. Just know it will be interrupted by random events, disastrous physics, hostile creatures, and – worst of all – <i>your friends</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/40a070fc8ac61b1ea832f1d99964e833.webp?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.poster.avif?t=1787315223\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.webm?t=1787315223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets